<!--
  BILINGUAL, NOT LOCALIZED.

  Every label shows English and Tagalog TOGETHER, always, on the same
  screen. This is a deliberate design decision from the Claude Design
  source: the workforce reads both, and a language toggle would mean a
  worker can end up on a screen they cannot read.

  So: do NOT move the _tl strings into values-fil/. They are not a
  translation, they are part of the label. See BilingualText().
-->
